ncapital. The project presents an exceptional collection of super luxury duplex apartments that seamlessly blend contemporary design with timeless elegance, offering discerning homeowners an unparalleled lifestyle experience.  \n  \nMalabar Hill has long been synonymous with Mumbai's elite, where verdant landscapes meet panoramic Arabian Sea views, and where heritage blends effortlessly with modern sophistication. Runwal Malabar capitalizes on this prime location, offering residents the privilege of living in one of the city's most distinguished neighborhoods. The development's strategic position ensures effortless connectivity to South Mumbai's business districts, cultural landmarks, and entertainment hubs, while maintaining the tranquility and exclusivity that Malabar Hill is celebrated for.  \n  \nThe architectural vision behind Runwal Malabar emphasizes spaciousness, natural light, and breathtaking views. Each duplex apartment has been meticulously designed to maximize comfort and functionality, featuring expansive living areas, premium finishes, and state-of-the-art amenities. The thoughtful floor plans ensure privacy and grandeur, with every detail reflecting the developer's commitment to excellence. Large windows and private terraces frame spectacular vistas of the city skyline and the Arabian Sea, creating living spaces that are both inspiring and serene.  \nRunwal Group's legacy of delivering landmark projects across Mumbai is evident in every aspect of Runwal Malabar. The development incorporates world-class amenities designed to cater to the refined tastes of its residents, including contemporary fitness facilities, landscaped gardens, and sophisticated recreational spaces. The project's intimate scale ensures exclusivity and personalized attention, with limited residences spread across multiple floors, fostering a sense of community among like-minded individuals who appreciate the finer things in life.  \n  \nFor those seeking a residence that transcends conventional luxury, Runwal Malabar offers more than just a home—it presents a lifestyle statement. The combination of an iconic location, exceptional design, and the trusted Runwal Group brand creates an investment opportunity that promises enduring value. This is where Mumbai's most successful families choose to call home, where every sunrise brings new possibilities, and where the art of gracious living reaches its pinnacle. Runwal Malabar isn't just about occupying space in Malabar Hill; it's about embracing a legacy of distinction and creating memories in one of the world's most exclusive addresses.\n\nFloor Plans\n\n## Floor Plan\n\n![2 BHK Floor Plan](/floor-plan.jpg)\n\n🔒 Submit enquiry to unlock floor plan\n\nLocation\n\n## Location & Nearby\n\nMap - Dongarsi Road, Malabar Hill, Mumbai\n\n**Address:** Dongarsi Road, Malabar Hill, Mumbai\n\n**Close To:** Breach Candy, Kemps Corner, Nepean Sea Road, Walkeshwar, Chowpatty\n\n#### Schools\n\nCampion School, Cathedral & John Connon School, Bombay Scottish School\n\n#### Hospitals\n\nBreach Candy Hospital, Bhatia Hospital, Jaslok Hospital\n\n#### Restaurants\n\nSoam, Gajalee Sea Food Restaurant, Busaba\n\n#### Bank/ATMs\n\nHDFC Bank, ICICI Bank, Axis Bank\n\n#### Bus Stop\n\nTeen Batti Bus Stop, Malabar Hill Bus Stop, Walkeshwar Bus Stop\n\n#### Metro/Railway\n\nCharni Road Railway Station, Marine Lines Railway Station, Grant Road Railway Station\n\n#### Airport\n\nChhatrapati Shivaji Maharaj International Airport\n\n#### Petrol Pumps\n\nIndian Oil Petrol Pump Malabar Hill, Bharat Petroleum Breach Candy, HP Petrol Pump Kemps Corner\n\n#### Shopping Mall\n\nAtria Mall, Crossword Kemps Corner, High Street Phoenix\n\n#### Parks\n\nHanging Gardens, Kamala Nehru Park, Priyadarshini Park\n\n#### Place of Worship\n\nBabulnath Temple, Mahalaxmi Temple, Haji Ali Dargah\n\n#### Groceries\n\nNature's Basket, Foodhall, Le Marche\n\n#### Movie Theaters\n\nPVR Icon Andheri, INOX Nariman Point, Regal Cinema Colaba\n\n#### Police Station\n\nMalabar Hill Police Station, Gamdevi Police Station, Marine Drive Police Station\n\nFAQ\n\n## Frequently Asked Questions about RUNWAL MALABAR\n\nWhere is Runwal Malabar Exactly located?\n\nRunwal Malabar is located at Dongarsi Road, Malabar Hill, .\n\nIs Runwal Malabar Rera Registered?\n\nYes, It is RERA Registered with Rera Number Coming Soon. You can verify the details on the official RERA website.\n\nWhat are unit options available in Runwal Malabar?\n\nRunwal Malabar offers Super Luxury Duplex Apartments.\n\nWhat is the starting price of Duplex in Runwal Malabar?\n\nThe starting price of Duplex at Runwal Malabar is Coming Soon. Contact us for the latest pricing and offers.\n\nWhen is the Possession of Duplex?\n\nThe expected possession date for Runwal Malabar is New Launch.\n\nWhat are the nearest landmarks?\n\nKey landmarks near Runwal Malabar include **Schools:** Campion School, Cathedral & John Connon School, Bombay Scottish School  \n  \n **Hospitals:** Breach Candy Hospital, Bhatia Hospital, Jaslok Hospital  \n  \n **Restaurants:** Soam, Gajalee Sea Food Restaurant, Busaba  \n  \n **Bank/ATMs:** HDFC Bank, ICICI Bank, Axis Bank  \n  \n **Bus Stop:** Teen Batti Bus Stop, Malabar Hill Bus Stop, Walkeshwar Bus Stop  \n  \n **Metro/Railway:** Charni Road Railway Station, Marine Lines Railway Station, Grant Road Railway Station  \n  \n **Airport:** Chhatrapati Shivaji Maharaj International Airport  \n  \n **Petrol Pumps:** Indian Oil Petrol Pump Malabar Hill, Bharat Petroleum Breach Candy, HP Petrol Pump Kemps Corner  \n  \n **Shopping Mall:** Atria Mall, Crossword Kemps Corner, High Street Phoenix  \n  \n **Parks:** Hanging Gardens, Kamala Nehru Park, Priyadarshini Park  \n  \n **Place of Worship:** Babulnath Temple, Mahalaxmi Temple, Haji Ali Dargah  \n  \n **Groceries:** Nature's Basket, Foodhall, Le Marche  \n  \n **Movie Theaters:** PVR Icon Andheri, INOX Nariman Point, Regal Cinema Colaba  \n  \n **Police Station:** Malabar Hill Police Statio